  "details": "<p>The Barrington Atlas Directory notes: Largo Preneste. In an etching included in his 1817 publication <em>Degli edifici antichi e moderni di Roma</em>, Giovanni Battista Cipriani identified the tomb as the \"tempio della speranza vecchia\".<span style=\"text-decoration: underline; \"><br /></span></p>",
